{"place":"estate-interlace","num":64,"row":["estate-interlace",1.2825867707509881,103.80321417012107,"新加坡翠城新景","The Interlace, Singapore","SG","新加坡 紅山","building","翠城新景（The Interlace）位於新加坡，由奧雷．舍人與 OMA 設計，2013 年完工，31 棟六層住宅以六角形交錯堆疊、圍出八個庭院，共 1,040 戶，2015 年獲世界建築節年度建築。","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Interlace",0,"新加坡翠城新景",""],"name":{"zh-Hant":"新加坡翠城新景","en":"The Interlace, Singapore","zh-Hans":"新加坡翠城新景"},"center":[1.2825867707509881,103.80321417012107],"airspace":{"zh":"在新加坡飛行空拍機須遵守新加坡民航局（CAAS）規定，許多區域需事先申請許可；本片為電腦擬真畫面，非實地空拍。","en":"Drones in Singapore fall under CAAS rules; many areas need a permit first. This film is simulated, not real drone footage.","src":"https://www.caas.gov.sg/public-passengers/unmanned-aircraft"},"pois":{"lace":{"zh":"翠城新景","en":"The Interlace","lat":1.2825867707509881,"lon":103.80321417012107,"note":"up to 24 floors","src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Interlace","h":77},"stack":{"zh":"中央的堆疊","en":"The central stack","lat":1.2828113485447359,"lon":103.8033309798346,"note":"four blocks high","src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Interlace","h":77},"court":{"zh":"庭院","en":"A courtyard","lat":1.2821555813869925,"lon":103.80317822867075,"note":"one of the eight courtyards","src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Interlace","h":30},"court2":{"zh":"東側庭院","en":"Eastern courtyard","lat":1.282191513833992,"lon":103.80407676492875,"note":"one of the eight courtyards","src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Interlace","h":25},"shw":{"zh":"12 月的影子","en":"Shadow on 21 December","lat":1.2825867707509881,"lon":103.80321417012107,"note":"at about 1 p.m. on 21 December","src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Interlace"},"shs":{"zh":"6 月的影子","en":"Shadow on 21 June","lat":1.2825867707509881,"lon":103.80321417012107,"note":"at about 1 p.m. on 21 June","src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Interlace"}},"photos":[],"tours":[{"id":"estate","theme":"estate","title":{"zh-Hant":"新加坡：翠城新景","en":"Singapore: The Interlace"},"tagline":{"zh-Hant":"31 棟住宅