 swimming pools and gardens,","along with a gym and tennis courts."],"time":"2026-06-21 07:55","time1":"08:00","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.15,"base":1400},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":26,"move":"orbit","at":"shw","weather":"few","alt":480,"dist":560,"from":120,"arc":25,"pitch":-44,"zh":["日照：新加坡靠近赤道，","12 月中午的太陽在南方高處，影子短短地落向北邊。"],"en":["Sun and shade: Singapore lies near the equator;","at midday in December the sun is high in the south, and short shadows fall north."],"time":"2026-12-21 12:58","time1":"13:08","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.1,"base":1600},"grade":{"warm":0.2,"sat":1.06,"contrast":1.08}}},{"dur":24,"move":"orbit","at":"shs","weather":"few","alt":480,"dist":560,"from":300,"arc":25,"pitch":-44,"zh":["到了 6 月，中午的太陽換到北方，","影子反過來落向南邊。"],"en":["In June the midday sun moves to the north,","and the shadows fall the other way, to the south."],"time":"2026-06-21 13:02","time1":"13:11","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.1,"base":1600},"grade":{"warm":0.2,"sat":1.06,"contrast":1.08}}},{"dur":26,"move":"pan","at":"court","weather":"few","alt":1.7,"clr":0.8,"dist":20,"from":180,"arc":-20,"pitch":14,"fov":70,"zh":["站在庭院裡往上看，","一層層交錯的樓板，在頭頂上搭出遮陰。"],"en":["Standing in a courtyard and looking up,","you see the crossing blocks cast shade overhead."],"time":"2026-06-21 08:10","time1":"08:17","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.15,"base":1400},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":28,"move":"orbit","at":"court2","weather":"few","alt":55,"dist":110,"from":250,"arc":50,"pitch":-4,"hero":true,"zh":["傍晚的陽光從交錯的縫隙間灑進庭院，","長條形的住宅，像一座座架在空中的橋。"],"en":["In the evening, light spills into the courtyards through the gaps,","and the long blocks look like bridges in the air."],"time":"2026-06-21 18:30","time1":"18:42","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":1400},"grade":{"warm":1.2,"sat":1.18,"contrast":1.1}}},{"dur":24,"move":"orbit","at":"lace","weather":"few","alt":220,"dist":520,"from":300,"arc":-40,"pit